{
    "id":  11557,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Industrial LED High Bay 150W UFO - NEW TITAN CCT - CHIP LUMILEDS SMD 2835",
    "reference":  "HB150W-CCT-91335-PACK10",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eLED UFO TITAN High Bay 150W NEW TITAN 3CCT,\u003c/b\u003e Designed to offer maximum efficiency and durability, this LED high bay incorporates \u003cstrong\u003eLUMILEDS SMD 2835\u003c/strong\u003e diodes, reaching up to \u003cstrong\u003e130 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eCRI +80\u003c/strong\u003e, and a \u003cstrong\u003epower factor +0.9\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eNo Flicker driver\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e90º lens\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee uniform and flicker-free lighting.\u003cbr\u003eBuilt in \u003cstrong\u003ealuminum + PC\u003c/strong\u003e and with \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 protection\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoor and indoor use\u003c/strong\u003e in demanding industrial environments.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eIndustrial LED High Bay 150W\u0026nbsp;UFO - NEW TITAN CCT - LUMILEDS SMD 2835 CHIP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThe \u003cb\u003eUFO TITAN 150W NEW TITAN 3CCT LED High Bay\u003c/b\u003e is an advanced industrial lighting solution, designed to deliver an optimal balance between energy efficiency, light quality and structural durability. Thanks to its innovative technology and premium materials, this luminaire stands out as one of the most reliable options for demanding industrial environments.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eEquipped with \u003cstrong\u003eLUMILEDS SMD 2835 LED diodes\u003c/strong\u003e, this high bay achieves a \u003cstrong\u003eluminous efficacy of up to 130 lumens per watt\u003c/strong\u003e, which translates into powerful, efficient lighting. It offers a \u003cstrong\u003ecolour rendering index (CRI) above 80\u003c/strong\u003e, guaranteeing faithful colour reproduction, essential in areas where visual accuracy matters. Its \u003cstrong\u003epower factor above 0.9\u003c/strong\u003e improves energy performance and reduces electricity consumption.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThe design incorporates a \u003cstrong\u003eNo Flicker driver\u003c/strong\u003e, which eliminates flickering light, protecting users\u0027 visual health and preventing eye strain — something essential in environments with continuous working hours. Its \u003cstrong\u003e90-degree lens\u003c/strong\u003e provides a uniform distribution of the light beam, ideal for installations on high ceilings.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eBuilt with a \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-strength aluminium and polycarbonate (PC) body\u003c/strong\u003e, this luminaire offers excellent heat dissipation and impact resistance. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 protection rating\u003c/strong\u003e makes it completely dust-tight and resistant to water jets, making it a suitable option for both \u003cstrong\u003eindoor\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoor\u003c/strong\u003e use, even in adverse weather conditions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eIn addition, it integrates a \u003cstrong\u003e10 kV surge protector\u003c/strong\u003e, which effectively protects the luminaire against electrical spikes and unstable mains conditions, extending the service life of the system and reducing the risk of faults or damage caused by surges.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUses and applications:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThe UFO TITAN 150W NEW TITAN 3CCT LED High Bay is especially suitable for a wide variety of industrial and commercial applications, such as:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndustrial units and logistics warehouses\u003c/strong\u003e, where powerful, long-lasting lighting is required to guarantee safety and productivity.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactories and production plants\u003c/strong\u003e, where colour rendering and stable lighting are key for quality control and precise operations.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eService stations, mechanical workshops and maintenance centres\u003c/strong\u003e, where the robustness of the equipment and clear visibility are essential.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupermarkets, distribution centres and large retail premises\u003c/strong\u003e, which need efficient, low-maintenance lighting.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndoor sports halls, gyms or industrial sports facilities\u003c/strong\u003e, where IP65 protection is ideal against moisture and dust.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCovered and open car parks\u003c/strong\u003e, taking advantage of its weather resistance and long service life.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThanks to its compact UFO-style design, ease of installation and energy efficiency, this luminaire represents an excellent investment for projects seeking to reduce operating costs without sacrificing light quality or reliability.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
